  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESOURCING GIRLS AND YOUNG WOMENS ACTIVISM IN THE GENERATION EQUALITY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;With and For Girls Fund&#x2019;, implemented by We Are Purposeful, supports girl-led feminist leader and activist groups participating in Generation Equality to engage in advocacy on issues of their choice, including disability rights, trans rights, sexual and reproductive health, and climate change. Plan International is a collaborating partner of the project, and will continue to support in providing engagement in the Generation Equality process in key advocacy moments when needed.</narrative>
  </description>
